sequence Take an order

customer = Customer "places the order" [color slate] [icon user]
shop = Shop app "takes the order" [color blue] [icon app]
ledger = Ledger "keeps the order" [color green] [icon db]

# Send the order
> The customer sends an order to the shop app, and the shop app keeps it in the ledger.
customer -> shop : place order
shop -> ledger : keep
